Intra-B Commerce: As discussed before, e-Business is wider than e-commerce.
e-Business includes not only e-commerce (B2B, B2C and C2C) but also Intra-B
Commerce'. Intra-B Commerce refers to interaction and dealings among various
departments and persons within the firm.
It includes the use of intranet to interact and deal between various
departments and persons within a firm.The use of intra-B commerce has
facilitated flexible manufacturing.
For example, the marketing department may interact regularly with the
production department and get the products made as per the requirements
of the customers.
प्रारं BATCH
